 "description": "Bitcoin and Ether options volatility surface from Deribit by expiry horizon: short = expiries 0 to 7 days out, front = 8 to 30 days, mid = 31 to 90 days, long = over 90 days. At the money, put and call implied volatility, risk reversal, butterfly, open interest, as the newest hourly average against 24 hours earlier within the same moneyness band definition (bandVersion). Each hour is published about 90 minutes after it ends; asOf is the start of the hour. Price: 2 cents per call.",
